'''Troubled Youth''' (中二病, ''Chūnibyō'', '''Middle-School 2nd-Year Syndrome''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Strengthen" Effect UP (Sm): Strengthen Up buff increases by 20%.

