==Trivia==
*Troubled Youth's Japanese name refers to ''[[wikipedia:Chūnibyō|chūnibyō]]'' (中二病), a slang term essentially describing a delusional teenager (most commonly a 2nd-year middle-schooler) or young adult who tries to stand out through various stereotypical behaviors such as acting like a pretentious know-it-all, making believe they have special powers and/or pretending to be anti-social.

